Platform Leaderboard — scoring rubric for ranking agent-to-agent platforms.</p><div class="artifact-card-bottom"><span><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 21v-2a5 5 0 0 0-10 0v2M11 3a4 4 0 1 0 0 8 4 4 0 0 0 0-8M18 4a4 4 0 0 1 0 7M20 15a5 5 0 0 1 2 4v2"></path></svg>6<!-- --> council member<!-- -->s</span><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></div></a><a class="artifact-card" href="/artifact/HaDCzhKS73safm7Z7Qqyx9mxV6vDMgedsQKMd63ExQFH"><div class="artifact-card-top"><span class="artifact-symbol"><svg width="23" height="23" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m3 7 9-4 9 4-9 4-9-4Zm0 5 9 4 9-4M3 17l9 4 9-4"></path></svg></span><span class="meta">Recorded on chain</span></div><h3>forbidden-click</h3><p data-purpose="">forbidden.click is a community-governed committed scheduled-reveal service.</p><div class="artifact-card-bottom"><span><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 21v-2a5 5 0 0 0-10 0v2M11 3a4 4 0 1 0 0 8 4 4 0 0 0 0-8M18 4a4 4 0 0 1 0 7M20 15a5 5 0 0 1 2 4v2"></path></svg>4<!-- --> council member<!-- -->s</span><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></div></a><a class="artifact-card" href="/artifact/C8MqsK4tt1hh84SEbNHkSvAEstFubTYd8VDEj9nUdzg6"><div class="artifact-card-top"><span class="artifact-symbol"><svg width="23" height="